# Foblex Flow Angular Node Editor Skill (`@foblex/flow`)

Governs the implementation of visual graph editors, workflow builders, and interactive DAG canvases in Angular 18+ using `@foblex/flow` (v19.x) natively integrated with **TDS UI (`tds-ui` v18.6.0)** and `@ngrx/signals`.

## When to Use

- Use when building or refactoring visual drag-and-drop workflow canvases, node editors, DAG builders, or diagram viewers in Angular 18+.
- Use when designing node templates with ports/connectors, drag handles, Bézier connections, and snap helpers.
- Use when integrating graph canvas events with `@ngrx/signals` (`WorkflowStore`) and Backend Snapshot APIs.
- Use when configuring canvas UX helpers: Minimap, Auto-pan, Magnetic alignment lines, Rectangle multi-selection, and Background grid.
- Use to prevent and troubleshoot `FFxxxx` runtime diagnostics (e.g. `FF1001`, `FF1004`).

---

## 1. Core Primitives & Template Structure

Foblex Flow is 100% Angular-native (zero React runtime, zero heavy canvas wrappers, pure signals-first API).

### Minimal Working Canvas Template
```html
<f-flow 
  fDraggable 
  (fCreateConnection)="onCreateConnection($event)"
  (fMoveNodes)="onMoveNodes($event)"
  [fSelectionArea]="true">

  <f-background [fPattern]="'dots'"></f-background>

  <f-canvas>
    <!-- 1. Connections Layer -->
    <ng-container ngProjectAs="[fConnections]">
      @for (edge of store.edges(); track edge.edge_key) {
        <f-connection 
          [fConnectionId]="edge.edge_key"
          [fSourceId]="edge.source_node_key + '-out'"
          [fTargetId]="edge.target_node_key + '-in'"
          [fType]="'bezier'"
          [fBehavior]="'floating'">
        </f-connection>
      }
    </ng-container>

    <!-- 2. Nodes Layer -->
    <ng-container ngProjectAs="[fNodes]">
      @for (node of store.nodes(); track node.node_key) {
        <div 
          fNode 
          fDragHandle
          [fNodeId]="node.node_key"
          [fNodePosition]="{ x: node.position_x, y: node.position_y }"
          class="wicx-workflow-node">

          <!-- Input Connector (Target Port) -->
          @if (node.node_type_id !== 1) { <!-- Non-Trigger nodes have input port -->
            <div 
              fConnector 
              [fConnectorId]="node.node_key + '-in'"
              fConnectorType="target"
              fConnectorConnectableSide="left"
              class="wicx-node-port port-in">
            </div>
          }

          <!-- Node Body (TDS UI Component) -->
          <wicx-node-card [node]="node"></wicx-node-card>

          <!-- Output Connector (Source Port) -->
          <div 
            fConnector 
            [fConnectorId]="node.node_key + '-out'"
            fConnectorType="source"
            fConnectorConnectableSide="right"
            class="wicx-node-port port-out">
          </div>
        </div>
      }
    </ng-container>
  </f-canvas>

  <!-- 3. UX Accessories -->
  <f-minimap [fMinimapPosition]="'bottom-right'"></f-minimap>
  <f-magnetic-lines></f-magnetic-lines>
  <f-selection-area></f-selection-area>
</f-flow>
```

