## 2. Integration with TDS UI v18.6.0 (`tds-ui`)

Never use hardcoded hex colors or generic styles. Wrap TDS UI cards inside `fNode` and style connections via TDS tokens.

### A. Node Card Presentation (`<wicx-node-card>`)
```html
<tds-card class="rounded-xl border tds-color-border-primary tds-color-surface-lowest shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
  <tds-card-header class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 border-b tds-color-border-secondary">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <i [class]="nodeGroupIcon(node.node_type_id)" class="text-lg"></i>
      <span class="font-semibold text-sm tds-color-text-primary">{{ node.label }}</span>
    </div>
    <tds-tag-multi-color [tdsColor]="nodeGroupColor(node.node_type_id)" tdsSize="sm">
      {{ nodeGroupName(node.node_type_id) }}
    </tds-tag-multi-color>
  </tds-card-header>

  <tds-card-content class="p-3 text-xs tds-color-text-secondary">
    <div>ID: <span class="font-mono">{{ node.node_key }}</span></div>
    <div class="truncate">Config: {{ node.node_config }}</div>
  </tds-card-content>
</tds-card>
```

### B. Styling Foblex Connections with TDS Tokens (`styles.scss` / `::ng-deep`)
```scss
::ng-deep .f-connection {
  .f-connection-path {
    stroke: var(--tds-color-border-primary);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    fill: none;
    transition: stroke 0.2s ease, stroke-width 0.2s ease;
  }

  &.f-selected .f-connection-path {
    stroke: var(--tds-color-border-brand-primary);
    stroke-width: 3.5;
  }

  &.state-running .f-connection-path {
    stroke: var(--tds-color-border-success);
    stroke-dasharray: 6;
    animation: dash-flow 1s linear infinite;
  }

  &.state-error .f-connection-path {
    stroke: var(--tds-color-border-error);
  }

  .f-connection-selection {
    stroke-width: 12; // Invisible fat clickable hit-area
    stroke: transparent;
  }
}

@keyframes dash-flow {
  to {
    stroke-dashoffset: -12;
  }
}
```

